sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Host / client
  participant M as Model API
  participant S as Learn server
  Note over H,S: Configured provider, discovered tools, selected schemas loaded
  H->>M: Documentation task and available tool context
  M-->>H: Search + fetch requests in one response
  H->>S: Route each request through tools/call
  S-->>H: Source material for each request
  H->>M: Adapted tool results
  M-->>H: Explanation and citation
  Note over H,S: Schematic routing, execution concurrency not measured
